of reverberation chambers, designed for everything from small IoT devices to large-format base stations and live-human testing.","tn28e2e128":"solutions for all industries","t2738d3c4":"Healthcare &amp; medical","t3da5904c":"Telecommunication","tn2e01e01e":"IoT / WLAN / Bluetooth","t39503ffa":"Defense &amp; security","t5dd343e4":"Every angle covered","t1897de6c":"Fast testing","tn2bfcb51c":"Cut OTA testing time by 90%. Our reverberation technology leverages natural multipath physics to deliver full TRP and throughput results in minutes, not hours","tn58145ff0":"Ease of use","t43824123":"Master complex RF physics with a drag-and-drop interface. Bluetest Flow automates 4x4 MIMO and Wi-Fi 7 setups without requiring a single line of code","t18db5a9a":"Value for money","tn3d1560c2":"Maximize ROI with one future-proof system. Test everything from legacy 2G to 5G mmWave in a single chamber, saving critical floor space and capital.","tn61e4c2e4":"Great support","tn50e56796":"Direct access to the pioneers of reverberation. Get application support globally, from our Gothenburg R&amp;D headquarters and our local partners in your time zone.","t7f274abe":"Contact us","tn21a3d66d":"Not ready? Test your products on-demand","t6162b07c":"Not yet ready to invest in your own OTA test system? Then why not come and visit us in Gothenburg, Sweden, and do your radio device/antenna evaluation in our R&amp;D lab? The lab is equipped with chambers and communication testers supporting measurements on most device sizes, and wireless standards such as 4G, 5G, Wi-Fi, and Bluetooth.","t15227ab9":"new at bluetest","tn2094398b":"News, stories &amp; press","ta25edcb":"All news &amp; stories","tn64202ba3":"Company","t1ed033d4":"Address","t432ef84d":"+46 31 778 6161","t43c65a60":"sales@bluetest.se","t3eb4f971":"Social Media","tn1a2819cc":"Navigation","t645efc51":"About Us","tn530b3473":"Healthcare","tn40b1d9e0":"Defense","tn4b8f3e15":"IoT&nbsp;Devices","tn7bc27f6b":"Careers","tn64104400":"Contact","t35c884dc":"Subscribe to our newsletter","tn6329b7f0":"Keep up on our always evolving product features and technology. Enter your e-mail and subscribe to our newsletter.","t5a0ea5a1":"Thank you! Your submission has been received!","tn7c112e99":"Oops! Something went wrong while submitting the form.","tn3fbde6f6":"Privacy Policy","t64169e54":"Environmental Policy"},"textarea":{"tan3f34f8cd":"One chamber, <br>every device","ta42505393":"Better solutions <span class=\"text-color-gray\">for over 20 years</span>","tan5ce3283d":"Bluetest has spent two decades turning complex OTA into fast, repeatable results. We pioneered reverberation-chamber OTA in 2000 and today partner with eight of the world’s ten largest handset makers, as well as leading operators, IoT, automotive, and defense innovators.<br><br>Our patented Reverberation Test System (RTS) chambers and Flow software compress verification cycles from hours to minutes, delivering TRP, TIS, and throughput in a realistic multipath environment without bulky positioners. RTS systems are purpose-built for modern wireless technologies, from compact IoT and Wi-Fi devices in <a href=\"chamber/rts25\">RTS25</a>/<a href=\"chamber/rts65\">RTS65</a> to large form-factor products and live-person testing in the <a href=\"chamber/rts95b\">RTS95B</a> chamber.<br><br>Installed in 40+ countries and backed by the Flow platform (Manager, Touch, Analyzer) for automation and reporting, Bluetest is the proven path to confident OTA decisions, whether you’re optimizing a prototype or validating against the latest standards, including base-station methods in 3GPP TS38.141-2.","tan61d0925a":"Bluetest is a pioneer in wireless test solutions through innovative application of the reverberation chamber technology.<br><br>Read more <a href=\"about-us\">about us.</a>\n                    ","tan502daf24":"<strong>Lindholmsallén 10</strong>,<br>SE-417 55 Göteborg, Sweden"},"richtext":{"r3fbe8166":""},"iframe":{"i7d88939a":"https://customer-wxu3g01bfxaadfzb.cloudflarestream.com/1aabd14a1479d5972552286609c1cef3/iframe?muted=true&autoplay=true&loop=true&controls=false&letterboxColor=transparent&poster=https%3A%2F%2Fcustomer-wxu3g01bfxaadfzb.cloudflarestream.com%2F1aabd14a1479d5972552286609c1cef3%2Fthumbnails%2Fthumbnail.jpg%3Ftime%3D%26height%3D600","i44a45fb0":"videos/hf_20260327_092118_8cde4053-8a8c-4f51-8460-a46830e43c50_mp4.mp4","i-158944f6":"videos/hf_20260327_092118_8cde4053-8a8c-4f51-8460-a46830e43c50_webm.webm"}}